# tcg-unity-engine/

Future home for the standalone Unity engine port of the TCG.

The current Unity template lives at `tcg-web-prototype/unity/` (Assets/ layout with engine stubs,
gated on `decks.json` rebuild). This repo folder is reserved for a full Unity solution/project
separate from the web prototype.

Placeholder so the folder is tracked by git. Delete this file once the engine project lands here.